title: Cherokee
key: Bb
tempo: 240
style: jazz

// Sixty-four bars, AABA, sixteen to a section, fast. The A sections take
// their time: the one, the four, the four made minor, the two as a
// dominant. The bridge is two-fives, a bar to a chord, falling through B, A, G and
// F, each landing held for two bars, and the last two-five is the way back
// to B-flat.
